# Reviews Folder

Store your previous performance reviews here for reference and pattern analysis.

Suggested naming convention:
- Quarterly: YYYY-Q#-Review.md (e.g., 2025-Q4-Review.md)
- Annual: YYYY-Annual-Review.md (e.g., 2025-Annual-Review.md)

The personal-review skill will analyze these documents to help draft future reviews that maintain consistency with your style and highlight career progression.
